Too true, unfortunately. But word at Apple is that v 2.0 of the
Newton OS will include significant improvements in recognition
speed/accuracy (that skinny's from the engineers, not marketing types). 


>So I asked if it were able, (or if he thought in the future it could
>be expanded to be able), to read shorthand.
